sacct-reporter 1.0 — INSTALL
============================

1. Prerequisites

      gcc 4.1 and make
      yum install sacct-metrics-devel    (the one extra package)

   If yum cannot find the package, your mirror is stale — see your
   sysadmin.

2. Build

      ./build.sh

3. Run

      ./sacct-reporter report --csv month.csv

There is no step 4. The build is deterministic: same box, same tools,
same binary, every rebuild — see the README notes.
